    ["与誓约组队完成各类日常玩法即可获得誓约值与同行纹章，誓约值可用于自动提升誓约等级。\n誓约等级共设多级，达到指定等级可领取等级奖励。\n非凡者每日与单个誓约最多可获取600誓约值，每周最多可获取2000誓约值。与誓约对象组队参与指定活动，还可额外获得同行纹章。\n双人模式下和誓约伙伴一起进入乌托邦剧院，可提升至副本达标评分，还会获得更多誓约值与同行纹章。\n同行纹章可用于在同行商店购买物品（誓约相关的奖励需要与誓约的等级达到指定要求）。\n非凡者可点击更换展台，进入与对应誓约对象的主页编辑功能，非凡者可更换自己角色的动作（不可编辑对方的），更换双人主页的展台，摆放摆件。\n非凡者可以在萨默尔太太处申请单人解契，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳绑定苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间发起申请的非凡者可以取消解契。\n非凡者也可组队前往萨默尔太太处申请双人解除解约，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳少量绑定苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间双方可以取消解契。"] = "Team up with your Covenant partner to complete various daily activities to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase your Covenant Level.\nThere are multiple Covenant Levels; reach the specified level to claim level rewards.\nПотустороннийs can earn a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner and a maximum of 2000 per week. Teaming up with your Covenant partner to participate in designated activities will also grant additional Companion Emblems.\nEntering the Utopia Theater with your Covenant partner in duo mode allows you to reach the dungeon's target rating and earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems.\nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require reaching the specified Covenant Level).\nПотустороннийs can click to change the display stand, enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Covenant partner, change their character's pose (cannot edit the other person's), change the duo homepage display stand, and place ornaments.\nПотустороннийs can apply for a solo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution.\nПотустороннийs can also team up to apply for a duo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
